C X16 EX PST-003,ARC-019 | MUST (placement convention; enforcement reminders key on these paths) | EF Core persistence code is organised under backend/<Name>.Infrastructure/Persistence/: the DbSeeder in Persistence/Seeding/, migrations in Persistence/Migrations/, entity configurations in Persistence/Configurations/ and the DbContext file there. | backend persistence layout | none stated | PST-003 requires a dedicated internal seeder surface and ARC-019 keeps EF Core in Infrastructure, but no oracle policy fixes folder paths; the candidate binds concrete folders and its Stop-hook reminders only recognise these paths. | A seeder placed outside Infrastructure/Persistence/Seeding/ is non-conformant and is not recognised by the seed co-change reminder.
