C R71 OL ARC-015 | MUST NOT | Application must not depend on IGenericRepository<T> or another generic CRUD contract; a generic repository/base class may exist only as an Infrastructure detail that removes real duplication. | backend repositories | Infrastructure-only generic base removing real duplication
