11 MX X13,R285,R10,X15 | ⟫ one line combining the instruction dependency direction and Conforms-line rule (EXTRA), the product-input precedence claim (resolved as oracle decision control, R285), capability-selection changes via architecture-decision (oracle GOV-017/ARC-020) and template-maintenance routing (EXTRA)
13-20 DU X14 | View 1 OP/DEC table: navigation rows restating what CLAUDE.md and the decision register own, their loading and when to extend them; the rules are owned by those files
