72-94 DU X14 | KNW table: navigation rows for knowledge skills (technique ownership and loading); content captured in the skills
96-114 DU X14 | ENF table: navigation rows describing hooks/scripts/config and their triggers; enforcement behavior is captured in the scripts and settings.json
116-121 DU X14 | IN table: navigation rows for SPECIFICATION.md and CUSTOM_SETTINGS.md restating their role and edit-hook reminders captured in actual-state.cjs
123-126 DU X14 | maintenance-metadata heading and table header
